ss_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"TEv0kn08Hq2UZ3k74Ieh_Q","review_id":"bE1xnEvPQsJ6vcY-FPOIyQ","date":"2016-09-26T18:42:22","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9574813842773438,"text_excerpt":"Solid spot for beignets on St Charles (directly behind New Orleans Hamburger & Seafood) if you want to get away from the hustle and bustle of Cafe Du Monde in the French Quarter. We stopped here one evening after finding them on Yelp. They were closing in 30 min and the employee was still so pleasant and friendly even for it being so late. We ordered beignets to go along with Cafe Au Lait. The beignets were piping hot , doughy and freshly made . They definitely do not premake here and , for that, I am impressed. I wish we had ordered the chocolate beignets bc , after the fact, I saw lots of rave reviews about. The location is spacious and a great spot to come to when you get the early/mid..."},{"business_id":"TEv0kn08Hq2UZ3k74Ieh_Q","review_id":"FA9lcjR9XKJUUow3aOw62A","date":"2020-03-07T23:15:20","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9512428045272827,"text_excerpt":"This is a cute little spot right on St. Charles. I've only ever gotten the beignets and cafe au laits here. I definitely think the beignets are pretty comparable to Cafe du Monde's beignets. I've never been disappointed by them! They also make pretty solid cafe au laits, though I have had better ones in other coffeeshops around New Orleans. There's never really a long line and its easy to find seating if needed. Parking is also easy around this area. Would definitely recommend checking out."},{"business_id":"TEv0kn08Hq2UZ3k74Ieh_Q","review_id":"TMweccmhGgoAN8aUL4U6sA","date":"2015-11-08T22:52:39","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9446069002151489,"text_excerpt":"Great beignets and good coffee drinks, too! My boyfriend and I especially love the pretzel croissants. Perfect location near home, and to anybody staying uptown that doesn't want to go all the way to the quarter for beignets. They have an easy free parking lot as well, so no worries if you're driving. The only thing I wouldn't recommend is their mini beignets - too much crunchy crust and not enough pillowy middle. Beignets should be big! And their big ones are the bomb. Make sure to pick up their frequent buyer card if you're a local - 5th visit is free!"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"TEv0kn08Hq2UZ3k74Ieh_Q","photo_id":"5cLUaM3pla9Jsu0zkdl5uw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/5cLUaM3pla9Jsu0zkdl5uw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8500109910964966},{"business_id":"TEv0kn08Hq2UZ3k74Ieh_Q","photo_id":"SD6lqE8ZGYeynaKh3F7jzA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/SD6lqE8ZGYeynaKh3F7jzA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8468954563140869},{"business_id":"TEv0kn08Hq2UZ3k74Ieh_Q","photo_id":"uP5EuQHtUji8-man9gHeIg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/uP5EuQHtUji8-man9gHeIg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8353374600410461},{"business_id":"TEv0kn08Hq2UZ3k74Ieh_Q","photo_id":"zphzS3nniAPhacWIDcGrUg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/zphzS3nniAPhacWIDcGrUg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8257526159286499},{"business_id":"TEv0kn08Hq2UZ3k74Ieh_Q","photo_id":"Stg7Yo3TGTcsWh97WgqkEA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/Stg7Yo3TGTcsWh97WgqkEA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8170179128646851}]},"notebook_case":null}
